p. After working there for about 5 months he isn't making any progress with Rokka. One day, when he goes into Rokka's home, which is just above the shop, Hazuki sees a young man in his underwear. He is Shimao Atsushi, Rokka's former husband ghost.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ypMD9ttQaLiKIdEryrlpQp5bUYa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"32345","synopsis":"Atsushi continues to try and get in the way of Hazuki and Rokka. Atsushi says he wants to make Rokka happy, but it's not clear how he can do this since he is dead. Hazuki takes Rokka out to dinner, and Rokka's emotions are sent back and forth as she thinks about both Hazuki and her dead husband Atsushi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4KgnGHMvdTkBHjoFAgS0caCRVIW.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Atsushi continues to try and get in the way of Hazuki and Rokka. Atsushi says he wants to make Rokka happy, but it's not clear how he can do this since he is dead. Hazuki takes Rokka out to dinner, and Rokka's emotions are sent back and forth as she thinks about both Hazuki and her dead husband Atsushi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4KgnGHMvdTkBHjoFAgS0caCRVIW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"32344","synopsis":"Rokka slowly recovers from her cold as Miho and Hazuki work at the flower shop. Atsushi gets more defensive about keeping Rokka to himself, but wants Hazuki's help. Hazuki is still skeptical about trusting Atsushi, and tries his best to care for Rokka, even though Rokka may still not be ready to move on.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cEtH7Q7ByUKhU4wuzds5aG4JvaC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Rokka slowly recovers from her cold as Miho and Hazuki work at the flower shop. Atsushi gets more defensive about keeping Rokka to himself, but wants Hazuki's help. Hazuki is still skeptical about trusting Atsushi, and tries his best to care for Rokka, even though Rokka may still not be ready to move on.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cEtH7Q7ByUKhU4wuzds5aG4JvaC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"32343","synopsis":"Hazuki takes Rokka to an amusement park, with the intention of making her smile. However, Rokka went to the same amusement park with Atsushi when he was alive. Because of this Rokka can't help but think about her memories with Atsushi. Hazuki tries to woo Rokka, but it might be all for nothing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wCnFks8bkcmW5JXuIsjQNnXAnWC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":