h to stop the love between Hazuki and Rokka.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6JzKXjNeRD9bwKJ9fbFzHvpGNJd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Rokka is surprised that she has fallen in love with someone other than Atsushi. Atsushi, who is still borrowing Hazuki's body, and Rokka go to the beach, while Hazuki is still stuck in dream land with mermaid-Rokka. Atsushi starts feeling helpless again, because he cannot do much to stop the love between Hazuki and Rokka.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6JzKXjNeRD9bwKJ9fbFzHvpGNJd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"32351","synopsis":"Atsushi, who is still controlling Hazuki's body, leaves a message for Rokka in the form of flower arrangements from her past. Once Rokka concludes that Hazuki has stolen all of Atsushi's things, she sets out to get them back. Meanwhile, in dream land, mini-Rokka explains to Hazuki that if he stays in this world for too long, he might end up forfeiting his body to Atsushi and be stuck here forever.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vlzDOtTmaZvBSsh1zYDSi2EGDnW.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Atsushi, who is still controlling Hazuki's body, leaves a message for Rokka in the form of flower arrangements from her past. Once Rokka concludes that Hazuki has stolen all of Atsushi's things, she sets out to get them back. Meanwhile, in dream land, mini-Rokka explains to Hazuki that if he stays in this world for too long, he might end up forfeiting his body to Atsushi and be stuck here forever.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vlzDOtTmaZvBSsh1zYDSi2EGDnW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"32350","synopsis":"Atsushi goes hiking to plant a part of himself in the mountains. Rokka catches up to him and finally realizes that Atsushi is somehow inside Hazuki's body. For the time being Hazuki still remains in dream land.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/by5QCDB0GyVewp0s0A0NtRktaZg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Atsushi goes hiking to plant a part of himself in the mountains. Rokka catches up to him and finally realizes that Atsushi is somehow inside Hazuki's body. For the time being Hazuki still remains in dream land.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/by5QCDB0GyVewp0s0A0NtRktaZg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9126","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13585","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45278","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"260361","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"32349","synopsis":"Hazuki finally makes it back to the real world, only to find himself a ghost, floating by helplessly as Shimao (in Hazuki's body) r